font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight">Questions, <span class="text-gold-gradient">Answered</span></h2></p></div><div class="reveal"><div class="space-y-4" data-orientation="vertical"><div class="border-b gold-border-gradient rounded-xl px-6 sm:px-8 border-none" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" data-testid="faq-accordion-item-0"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-:r1:" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 text-left font-semibold text-sm sm:text-base py-6 hover:text-gold hover:no-underline transition-colors" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" data-testid="faq-accordion-trigger-0" id="radix-:r0:" type="button">Do my customers need to download an app?<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="accordion-panel" data-testid="faq-accordion-content-0" role="region"><p class="accordion-panel-inner">No. TapReview works over standard NFC — the same contactless tech already built into every modern iPhone (XS and newer) and Android phone. Your customer simply holds their phone near the card for one second and their browser opens straight to your Google review form. Nothing to install, nothing to configure.</p></div></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-:r0:" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-:r1:" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"></div></div><div class="border-b gold-border-gradient rounded-xl px-6 sm:px-8 border-none" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" data-testid="faq-accordion-item-1"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-:r3:" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 text-left font-semibold text-sm sm:text-base py-6 hover:text-gold hover:no-underline transition-colors" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" data-testid="faq-accordion-trigger-1" id="radix-:r2:" type="button">Are there any monthly subscription fees?<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="accordion-panel" data-testid="faq-accordion-content-1" role="region"><p class="accordion-panel-inner">Never. Every TapReview card is a single, one-time purchase. You own the hardware outright, there's no monthly fee, no recurring platform cost and no per-scan charge — no matter how many reviews it generates.</p></div></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-:r2:" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-:r3:" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"></div></div><div class="border-b gold-border-gradient rounded-xl px-6 sm:px-8 border-none" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" data-testid="faq-accordion-item-2"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-:r5:" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 text-left font-semibold text-sm sm:text-base py-6 hover:text-gold hover:no-underline transition-colors" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" data-testid="faq-accordion-trigger-2" id="radix-:r4:" type="button">How do you program my Google Review link?<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="accordion-panel" data-testid="faq-accordion-content-2" role="region"><p class="accordion-panel-inner">After checkout you'll send us the direct link to your Google Business Profile review form (we'll email you simple instructions). Our team encodes that link onto your card's NTAG213 chip before it ships, so every tap opens your exact review page — pre-programmed and ready to go out of the box.</p></div></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-:r4:" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-:r5:" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"></div></div><div class="border-b gold-border-gradient rounded-xl px-6 sm:px-8 border-none" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" data-testid="faq-accordion-item-3"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-controls="radix-:r7:" aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between 